      "text": "2. Smt. Indira Gandhi has been sworn-in as the Prime Minister by the President at 10-45 A.M. today, 14th January, 1980, in the Rashtrapati Bhavan. Other Ministers sworn-in by the President at 10-45 A.M. today, 14th January, 1980 are shown at Annexure 'B'.",
      "html": null,
      "reason": null
